  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Helpdesk  MR/Demokratisk Samh&#xe4;llsstyrning och PFM/Bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet Afrika</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Helpdesk for Human Rights/Dem. governance inkl. PFM/ Aid Effectiveness Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen &#xe4;r en Helpdesk f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter/demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning inkl offentlig finansiell styrning och bist&#xe5;ndseffektivitet. Det etablerades genom avrop fr&#xe5;n Sidas Ramavtal f&#xf6;r demokrati och offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning. Helpdesken skall utg&#xf6;ra en st&#xf6;dfunktion f&#xf6;r ambassader i Afrika och Afrikaavdelningen p&#xe5; Sida i Stockholm. Det kan anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r korttidsuppdrag p&#xe5; maximalt 10 dagar, inom ramen f&#xf6;r ovan n&#xe4;mnda tematiska omr&#xe5;den och i alla faser (planering, genomf&#xf6;rande, uppf&#xf6;ljning) av Sidas huvudprocesser, samt kapacitets- och kompetensutveckling f&#xf6;r ambassader i Afrika och Sida i Stockholm. Tj&#xe4;nsterna inkluderar att skriva rapporter eller andra dokument, g&#xf6;ra presentationer, delta i seminarier och diskussioner, delta i kortare missioner/uppdrag, ge muntliga eller skriftliga kommentarer, ge r&#xe5;d, utbildning eller annat st&#xf6;d. Andra tj&#xe4;nster kan ocks&#xe5; utg&#xf6;ra en del av kontraktet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a Human Rights/Democratic Governance Helpdesk including Public Financial Management and Aid Effectiveness.  It was established through a call-off from Sida&apos;s Framework Agreement for Democracy and Public Administration. The Help Desk is a support function for embassies in Africa and the Africa Department at Sida in Stockholm.  It may be used for short-term assignments for a maximum of 10 days within the above-mentioned thematic areas, in all phases (planning, implementation, follow-up) of Sida&apos;s main processes, as well as in capacity and skills development for embassies in Africa and Sida in Stockholm. Services may include: write reports or other documents, make presentations, participate in seminars and discussions, participate in shorter missions/assignments, give oral or written comments, advice, training and other support. Other services may also form part of the contract.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">This assignment was to set up a help-desk whose purpose it was to support the Africa Department&apos;s appraisal, decision-making, dialogue and follow-up processes within the specified areas&#xa0;(see below) through short term expert advice, offered on request from both Headquarters and Embassy level. The aim was also to complement and strengthen Sida&apos;s own resources and competences, and to provide capacity and competence development when requested.&#xa0;
The areas included for this helpdesk were: Local Democracy and Decentralisation, Political Institutions, Political Participation and Pluralism, State-building, State Capacity and Public Administration, Public Financial Management, Aid Effectiveness including Results Based Aid and Results Based Financing, Human Rights Systems, Defenders and Rule of Law, Non-Discrimination, Freedom of Expression and Media, and Human Rights Based Approach.
The services were available only to the Africa Department at Sida headquarters and to Swedish embassies in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
